  "long_description": "Eze is your all-in-one hub for IT asset management, procurement, and recovery. Easily track every laptop, phone, and license from purchase to retirement with real-time visibility across your organization. Need new equipment? Order directly from vetted suppliers at competitive prices. Upgrading? We’ll handle buybacks, trade-ins, and recycling — so you recover value from your old tech instead of letting it collect dust.\r\n\r\nFrom automated asset tracking to one-click purchasing and vendor management, Eze keeps your inventory accurate, your costs low, and your team focused on work that matters — not spreadsheets. Whether you’re scaling fast or streamlining operations, we make sure your IT is always working for you.",
